#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example shows a way to use the VS Visualizer sensors package with Matlab. (No Simulink required).
#
#This example shows the simulated vehicle with a camera sensor traveling on a road with forward traffic in two lanes and oncoming traffic in a third lane.
#
#The example script can be found in the database as "Extensions\VsSharedBufferMatlab\VSSharedBufferExample.m". If you execute this script while the VS Visualizer is running, it will sample from the sensor buffer and generate a 3D plot. Also included in this folder is a readme.txt with more detail on the included files.
#
#In this example, speed control is provided used ACC with a built-in sensor.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

